  planner_response {
    response: "To make a high-production, cinematic video combining **real-world travel footage, 3D app mockups, hyper-realistic voiceover, and seamless sound design**, here are the best AI video generators and tools categorized by what they do best:\n\n---\n\n# \360\237\217\206 Top AI Video Generators by Category\n\n---\n\n## 1. \360\237\216\245 Cinematic B-Roll & Real-World Footage Generation\n*(Use these to generate breathtaking 4K clips of Vietnam street food, drone shots over Ha Long Bay, scooters in Saigon, and smiling travelers)*\n\n| Tool | Best Feature | Why Choose It |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Google Veo 2 / VideoFX** | Photorealism, natural physics & lighting | Unbelievable detail for realistic travel landscapes and street scenes. |\n| **Luma Dream Machine (Ray 2)** | Dynamic camera motion & cinematic panning | Excellent for fast drone zooms, tracking shots behind scooters, and dramatic lighting. |\n| **Runway Gen-3 Alpha** | Camera control & text-to-video / image-to-video | Industry standard for filmmaker-level visuals, cinematic speed ramps, and texture. |\n| **Kling AI (v1.5 / v2.0)** | Super realistic human expressions & hands | Best at generating people eating street food, smiling, and talking without weird artifacts. |\n| **Minimax (Hailuo AI)** | Great motion prompt following & natural action | Very smooth human and vehicle movement. |\n\n> \360\237\222\241 **Pro-Tip for Travel B-Roll**: You can generate a still image first in Midjourney or Flux, and then upload it to **Runway Gen-3** or **Luma Dream Machine** (Image-to-Video) to get exact, photorealistic camera movement!\n\n---\n\n## 2. \360\237\222\273 AI App Demo, Screen Motion & 3D UI Animation\n*(Use these to turn raw screenshots/recordings of your app into floating 3D glass cards with Apple-style smooth camera moves)*\n\n| Tool | Best Feature | Why Choose It |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Jitter.video (AI Motion)** | Animated UI cards, icons, notifications & popups | Turn Figma or PNG exports of your app into slick animated motion graphics in seconds. |\n| **Screen Studio (AI Camera)** | Automatic smart zoom & smooth cursor tracking | Records your screen and automatically zooms into buttons when you click with cinematic ease curves. |\n| **Rotato** | 3D device mockups (iPhone 16 / MacBook Pro) | Renders your screen recording onto rotating, realistic 3D glass devices with studio lighting and lens blur. |\n\n---\n\n## 3. \360\237\216\231\357\270\217 AI Voiceover (Studio Quality)\n*(Use these to generate charismatic, confident narration that sounds 100% human)*\n\n| Tool | Best Feature | Recommended Voices |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **ElevenLabs** | Industry-leading human cadence, breathing, and emotion | *\342\200\234Adam\342\200\235* (Tech launch style), *\342\200\234Rachel\342\200\235* (Warm & clear), *\342\200\234Charlie\342\200\235* (Casual cosmopolitan) |\n| **OpenAI Voice Engine / TTS** | Ultra-clean, modern podcast/keynote delivery | *\342\200\234Alloy\342\200\235*, *\342\200\234Echo\342\200\235*, *\342\200\234Nova\342\200\235* |\n\n---\n\n## 4. \360\237\216\254 All-in-One AI Video Editors (Text-to-Full-Video)\n*(If you want an end-to-end tool that generates voiceover, auto-captions, stock clips, and music all at once)*\n\n| Tool | Best Feature | Why Choose It |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **CapCut (AI Video Tools)** | Auto-captions with kinetic animations, SFX library | The fastest tool to combine AI clips, screen recordings, text animations, and trending music. |\n| **InVideo AI** | Prompt to full draft video with voiceover and b-roll | Type your script prompt and it creates an entire sequenced draft video with VO and music. |\n| **Descript** | Edit video by editing text, AI eye contact, audio clean-up | Perfect if you record yourself talking to camera and want AI to fix mistakes and polish the sound. |\n\n---\n\n## 5. \360\237\216\265 AI Sound Effects & Music Generation\n*(For cinematic whooshes, haptic clicks, bank vault locks, and background beats)*\n\n| Tool | Purpose |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **ElevenLabs SFX** | Generate custom sound effects from text prompts (e.g. *\"Heavy metallic bank vault locking\"*, *\"Futuristic radar ping chime\"*, *\"Scooter accelerating on cobblestones\"*). |\n| **Suno AI / Udio** | Generate custom, royalty-free modern lo-fi / indie acoustic travel background tracks with specific BPM and mood. |\n\n---\n\n# \360\237\232\200 The Recommended Workflow (Takes ~1 to 2 Hours)\n\nHere is the exact stack top tech creators use to produce viral product videos:\n\n1. **Script**: Use the script provided above.\n2. **Voiceover**: Paste script into **ElevenLabs** $\\rightarrow$ download WAV.\n3. **App Clips**: Record your app with **Screen Studio** or mock them up in **Jitter / Rotato** (for the AI Tour Planner, Negotiation Hub, Safety PIN, and GPS Radar).\n4. **Cinematic Travel B-Roll**: Generate 4\342\200\2235 five-second clips using **Runway Gen-3** or **Luma Dream Machine** (e.g., *\"FPV drone flying low over Hoi An lantern river at dusk, cinematic 4K\"*).\n5. **Assembly & Polish**: Drop the voiceover, screen recordings, and AI travel clips into **CapCut**:\n   - Add **Auto-Captions** (styled with yellow/emerald bold text).\n   - Add background music from **Suno** or CapCut\'s library.\n   - Add sound effects (**ElevenLabs SFX**) on button taps and transitions.\n6. **Export**: 1080p or 4K 60FPS."
